  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">UNIDO Fond f&#xf6;r kapacitetsbyggnad inom handel</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNIDO Trade Capacity Building Trust Fund</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The UNIDO Trade Capacity Building Trust Fund supported by Sida aim to enable developing countries to improve their capacities to participate in international trade. The fund focus on assisting developing countries to analyze their shortcomings, formulate solutions and develop their participation in specialized technical organizations important for the capacity to trade.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">UNIDO:s fond f&#xf6;r Trade Capacity Building som st&#xf6;ds av Sida syftar till att f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttra utvecklingsl&#xe4;nders f&#xf6;rm&#xe5;ga att delta i den internationella handeln. Fonden fokuserar p&#xe5; att hj&#xe4;lpa utvecklingsl&#xe4;nderna att analysera sina brister, formulera l&#xf6;sningar och utveckla deras deltagande i tekniska organisationer som &#xe4;r viktiga f&#xf6;r deras kapacitet att bedriva handel.</narrative>
  </description>
